Full R-C Parasitic Extraction Commands for MAGIC VLSI:

gds read <file path to gds>
load <cell name>

select top cell
extract all
ext2sim labels on
ext2sim
extresist tolerance 10
extresist
ext2spice lvs
ext2spice cthresh 0
ext2spice extresist on

ext2spice

#if spice file does not generate, do ext2spice -o newfilename.spice





